Package: selfcheck
Type: Package
Title: Personal Data Forensics: Benford and Robust Anomaly Checks
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("chen", email = "wwwqwqQAQ@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A "digital forensics" toolbox for your own life data. It checks
    whether recorded numbers (expense amounts, sleep minutes, workout counts,
    anything a human types or an app logs) behave like naturally occurring
    numbers via Benford's law tests, flags outliers with robust statistics
    (MAD-based z-scores), and detects anomalous weeks in any date-value stream.
    Analysis core has zero hard dependencies; tidyverse helpers are optional.
